The complete runner log is
`/private/tmp/ckb-txpool-managed-150-91eefd6f3.log`. Every failure has now been
classified at its semantic owner:

- Committed verification errors detached the complete already-prefixed
  display string and then reconstructed the typed prefix, producing
  `Transaction(Transaction(...))` and `Script(Script(...))`. The journal now
  stores the bounded direct inner diagnostic and lets the typed kind render
  exactly once. A nested-error unit proves that intermediate context is also
  preserved rather than collapsed to the deepest root cause.
- `UncleBlockView::serialized_size_in_block()` already uses the consensus
  block-size basis that excludes uncle proposal payload. Subtracting proposal
  bytes a second time could underflow and suppress optional template content.
  The helper is now infallible on the canonical basis with an exact-size unit.
- `FeeOfMultipleMaxBlockProposalsLimit` counted the union of top-level and
  legal uncle proposals while asserting a top-level consensus limit. It now
  waits for the exact template height and asserts the top-level proposal zone.
- The same-block cell-dep/spender integration consumed a valid intermediate
  one-owner template from the intentionally optimistic partial lane. It now
  waits for the source level containing both completed admissions and directly
  asserts dependency-reader-before-spender order in the selected block.
- `RpcTruncate` assumed a resubmitted transaction always required a fresh
  top-level proposal. A detached proposal may remain valid through a legal
  uncle, so the test now observes the required committed outcome.
- Repeated execution exposed a separate product race: chain reconcile used the
  dedicated ordered channel, while `ClearPool` and `ClearPipeline` used the
  concurrent dispatcher. A clear issued after truncate could Apply first and
  then be overtaken by delayed detached recovery. The existing capacity-one
  lane is now the closed `ChainControl` sum of `Reconcile | ClearPool |
  ClearPipeline`; all three run to completion in producer order. No authority
  state, lock, version, task, rollback or repair path was added. Ordinary
  admission/read traffic and the five independent template lanes remain
  concurrent.

